// Title: Suspicious ClickFix/FileFix Execution Pattern
// Rule ID: d487ed4a-fd24-436d-a0b2-f4e95f7b2635
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1204.001, attack.t1204.004
// Category: process_creation
